Okay then, let's set up Secure Boot. Thankfully, you can use this script and do
not have to go through this ordeal on your own.

Before we start, we will install the following packages that will help us
through the process:
    - efitools: for accessing and manipulating UEFI variables
    - sbsigntools: for signing keys and binaries
    - systemd-ukify: for auto-signing UKIs after building them
